ROUTE HOSTING: the web route is the admin sub-path `/admin/disk-forecast`, which
`AppRouteParser` resolves to the top-level `.admin` route (the parser keys on the first
path segment). There is no native admin landing page / sub-router yet, and `.admin` is
otherwise unregistered (renders the pending state). `DiskForecastRouteRegistration`
therefore hosts the page on `.admin` so it is reachable via the System-group sidebar entry
and any `/admin/*` deep link; when an admin sub-router lands this becomes a
`/admin/disk-forecast` NavigationDestination. Recorded here per covenant #9.

